abstract: >-
  A manuscript, complete principal-result Lean formalization, and exact verification package for the
  equality of shared-randomness-convexified two-input qubit POVM and PVM Bell
  behavior sets, together with an exact rational 3 x 2 separation proving
  input-setting minimality.
